OL,3,ABurnham pressed on economy at first
OL,4,APMQs as borrowing costs surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham took over from Sir Keir Starmer
OL,7,Fin July before Parliament's summer
OL,8,Frecess, making Wednesday the first time
OL,9,Fhe had faced the Tory leader at PMQs.
